  - GUI
abstract: >-
  FiberLyse is a desktop application for transparent, GUI-based fiber photometry
  analysis. It supports Neurophotometrics/Bonsai-style recordings and configurable
  CSV layouts, including separate signal/reference columns and interleaved rows,
  with artifact handling, reference fitting, normalization, frequency analysis,
  AUC, batch comparison, and export tools.
